::BeforeSupplyChainCh3
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once 

//Introduced idea of cost vs time. Au doesn't show up till next level but P now has two sources. Setting up onboarding to learn how to pick between two sources of materials with Hennig Station (P) and Menuo station (P)Menuo is new Kalvis sector statio and Hennig is Frontier where Ovill is. 

//incoming call
{@Ovill}    We have a super duper exclusive deal just for you! 
{@Player}   Wait, wait, what are you even selling? 
{@Ovill}    Phosphorus! Commit to Hennig Station in the Forsch sector today and I'll throw in a complimentary Frontier Robotics swag bag! 
{@Player}   Ah... you are selling phosphorus. 
{@Player}	I hear that there is a new station... Menuo Station... near Kalvis that is selling phosphorus for much cheaper!
{@Ovill}    If you source with us, you will get the materials in a flash. We are fast, fast, fast. The fastest in the region!
{@Player}   I'll...lll... think about it. 
{@Ovill}    You didn't like my offer?  
{@Player}   Well, like I said, I'll THINK ABOUT IT.  
{@Ovill}	Fantastic! I'm glad you are excited! This is going to be a great deal for you. 
{@Ovill}    Anyways. I'm Ovill. 
{@Ovill}    Supplier and contact for the planets and stations of the Forsch sector. Holo back!
//end call


